note as BIZ_diagram_46_platform_ops
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  The operational backbone a data-center-grade deployment requires. Governs the
  platform's tools/technologies and the build/release artifacts they produce, the
  logical service components that run in each environment, their deployments, and
  continuous health checks with append-only run history and derived incidents.
  Complements qa_lab (pre-release testing), telemetry (product analytics) and
  system_ops (data governance) with runtime operations & SRE evidence. No PHI.
end note

