note right of health_incidents
  INCIDENT COMMAND MODEL
  An incident owns severity, responders, timeline, communications and postmortem.
  Every postmortem is blameless evidence; remediation remains assigned and verifiable.
end note

note right of service_level_objectives
  RELIABILITY CONTROL
  SLI -> SLO -> measurement -> error budget -> burn event.
  Exhausted budgets may require approval or deployment freeze by policy.
end note

note right of change_requests
  CHANGE SAFETY
  Every material production change records risk, approvals, maintenance window,
  validation and rollback plan. Emergency changes are still retrospectively reviewed.
end note

